# Book manuscripts, plans and source audits.
#
# This repo is public and a finished manuscript is a paid product, so the text
# stays out of history. The machinery, the docs and the per-book build recipe
# are the shareable parts; the book itself is not. Remove a line here only as
# a deliberate decision to publish that book's text.
projects/*/book/
